Egypt won the cup. However, India has been the most successful nation in
the tournament, winning it a total of four times.• Decline: The
tournament experienced a decline after 2012, with the lack of consistent
support and growing competition from other regional tournaments such as
the SAFF Championship and AFC Asian Cup.

