of India in 2018, focuses on accelerating the development of
underdeveloped districts across India.

• The program aims to improve key socio-economic indicators such as
education, healthcare, nutrition, infrastructure, and economic growth in
these districts.• It focuses on inclusive growth and addressing
disparities between regions.

