Q.52 \textbf{In each of these questions, a number series is given. In
each series, only one number is wrong number. Find out the wrong
number.} \textbf{2, 7, 25, 108, 531, 3193 \hspace{0pt}}

A. 3193\\
B. 531\\
C. 25\\
D. 108

Answer: D

Sol: Given:\\
2, 7, 25, 108, 531, 3193 \hspace{0pt}\\
Logic: miltiply by (2, 3, 4, 5, ...) + (3, 4 , 5, 6,...)\\
2 × 2 + 3 = 7\\
7 × 3 + 4 = 25\\
25 × 4 + 5 = 105 108\hspace{0pt}\\
105 × 5 + 6 = 531\\
531 × 6 + 7 = 3193\\
Thus, correct option is (d).

