Q.57 \textbf{All metals are good conductors of electricity. Copper is a
metal. Which conclusion can be drawn?}

A. Copper is not a conductor\\
B. Copper is a metal only\\
C. Copper is a poor conductor\\
D. Copper is a good conductor

Answer: D

Sol: Statement:\\
All metals are good conductors of electricity.

Copper is a metal.

Solution:\\
Since copper belongs to the group of metals, and all metals are good
conductors, it must also be a good conductor.\\
So, Copper is a good conductor.

Thus, correct option is (d).
