profile based on typical eligibility criteria:\\
70\% in B.Sc. -- Good academic record\\
M.Sc. completed -- Higher qualification achieved\\
3 years Maths teaching experience -- Relevant experience\\
25 years old -- Age is appropriate\\
Ready for probation -- Willingness to join under standard terms\\
She meets all the criteria for selection.

So, Select Meera directly\\
Thus, correct option is (c).

