Q.63 \textbf{Fill in the blank: 1, 2, 6, 24, 120, \_\_\_\_\_}

A. 840\\
B. 960\\
C. 720\\
D. 600

Answer: C

Sol: Given Series:\\
1, 2, 6, 24, 120, \_\_\_\\
Logic: This is a factorial series.\\
1 = 1!

2 = 2!

6 = 3!

24 = 4!

120 = 5!

Next = 6! = 720\\
Thus, correct option is (c).

Q.64 \textbf{Fill in the blank:}\\
\textbf{6, 24, 60, 120, \_\_\_\_\_\_ \hspace{0pt}}

A. 170\\
B. 210\\
C. 110\\
D. 200

Answer: B

Sol: Given:\\
6, 24, 60, 120, ?

Logic: Each term = n × (n+1) × (n+2)\\
Solution:\\
6 = 1×2×3\\
24 = 2×3×4\\
60 = 3×4×5\\
120 = 4×5×6\\
Next = 5×6×7 = 210\\
Thus, correct option is (b).

