Q.72 \textbf{In a group of 20 people, Anil is ranked 5th from the top.
What is his rank from the bottom?}

A. 15th\\
B. 17th\\
C. 16th\\
D. 14th

Answer: C

Sol: Given:\\
There are 20 people in the group.

Anil is ranked 5th from the top.

Use the formula:\\
Rank from bottom = Total number of people − Rank from top + 1\\
20−5+1=16th\\
Thus, correct option is (c).

