Q.78 \textbf{Which number does not belong:}

A. 123\\
B. 213\\
C. 212\\
D. 312

Answer: C

Sol: Logic: \textbar1st − 3rd\textbar{} = middle digit):\\
(a) 123 → \textbar1−3\textbar{} = 2 (middle = 2)\\
(b) 213 → \textbar2−3\textbar{} = 1 (middle = 1)\\
(c) 212 → \textbar2−2\textbar{} = 0 (middle = 1)\\
(d) 312 → \textbar3−2\textbar{} = 1 (middle = 1)\\
Thus, correct option is (c).
\end{quote}

