Q.82 \textbf{Anita is ranked 15th from the top in a class of 45
students. Sita is ranked 20th from the bottom. How many students are
there between Anita and Sita?}

A. 10\\
B. 9\\
C. 11\\
D. 12

Answer: A

Sol: Gievn:\\
Total students = 45\\
Anita = 15th from top\\
Sita = 20th from bottom\\
sol.

Sita from top = (45 -- 20 + 1) = 26th\\
Students between them = (26 -- 15 -- 1) = 10\\
Thus, correct option is (a).

