Q.98 \textbf{Find the next term in the given letter series: AAGHGHGH,
GAAHGHGH, GHAAGHGH, GHGAAHGH, GHGHAAGH, \_\_\_\_\_\_ .}

A. GHGHGHAA\\
B. GAAHGHGH\\
C. AAGHGHGH\\
D. GHGHGAAH

Answer: D

Sol: Given:\\
AAGHGHGH, GAAHGHGH, GHAAGHGH, GHGAAHGH, GHGHAAGH, \_\_\_\\
Logic:\\
The block ``AA'' shifts one position to the right in each successive
term (wrapping through the base alternating pattern GHGHGHGH).

Explanation:\\
Positions of AA by term → (1--2), (2--3), (3--4), (4--5), so next is
(5--6),\\
GHGHAAGH → GHGHGAAH.

Hence, Option D is the correct answer.

