B. Q\\
C. R\\
D. T

Answer: C

Sol: Given:\\
Q is to the right of P but left of R.

T is to the right of R but left of U.

From the given information the seating arrangement will be

\includegraphics[width=2.00694in,height=0.68056in]{vertopal_3d0b0d13ceb344a0aa13e91d868b487a/media/image33.png}

