\begin{quote}
\textbf{Read the following passage and answer the questions based on the
passage:}\\
\textbf{Wildlife conservation has increased in importance since
governments and NGOs have realized that locals are vital guardians of
the environment. Instead of mandating top-down orders, successful
initiatives recruit villagers to protect threatened species, serve as
informants, and generate income from ecotourism. In other parts of
Africa and Asia, community rangers are taught tracking and first aid,
while women\textquotesingle s organizations produce handicrafts out of
