D. for

Answer: D

Sol: The correct option to fill in the blank is (d) \textbf{for}.

\textbf{Explanation:} The fixed and idiomatic expression is
\textbf{``lay down one's life for (someone/something)''}, meaning to
\textbf{sacrifice one's life in the service or defence of} that
person/cause. Hence, \textbf{for the nation}
\end{quote}

